    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been feeling super weird lately. im drinking like a ton of water because i feel thirsty all the time, but then im running to the bathroom every hour. also my breath smells kinda funny, like sweet or fruity? idk if its just dehydration or something else. what do u think?",
