      "content": "Do not rely on Gatorade or home remedies, as your symptoms mimic high blood sugar which can become life-threatening very quickly. There is no safe way to skip medical testing, especially since low blood sugar is another serious risk if you were already diabetic and tried to treat it incorrectly. Please seek emergency care or a community health clinic immediately, as delaying this could lead to diabetic ketoacidosis or severe complications.",
