    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but it feels like a lot to jump to an emergency room over this. i'm not even sure i have diabetes, i'm just tired. if i just take some extra vitamins and try to cut back on sugar for a few days, can i just monitor it myself at home? i'd rather just try to fix it naturally before making a big deal out of it.",
