      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Cutting back on sugar or taking vitamins will not stop the symptoms you are describing; if you have high blood sugar, your kidneys cannot filter the waste properly no matter how much water you drink, which can lead to coma. Trying to monitor this at home is extremely risky because without blood tests, you could develop toxic levels of ketones in your body very quickly. Please take small steps to get tested at a free community clinic or food bank tomorrow; your life is too precious to gamble on home remedies alone.",
